  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.9.0 adds expanded linear, quadratic and nonlinear optimization methods; sparse and operator-based least squares; MINRES, flexible GMRES and additional preconditioners; sparse symmetric indefinite factorization; and reusable weighted kernel density estimates with advanced bandwidth selection and boundary correction. Includes optimizer and numerical reliability fixes.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
